<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 13,000 tonnes of white sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 13,000 tonnes of white sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought on Wednesday a cargo of 13,000 tonnes of white sugar for shipment in June 1997 at a snap tender, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They said the price was $346.5 per tonne C&amp;F, they added.</p>
</text>
